    "title": "pandas.tseries.offsets.SemiMonthBegin.day_of_month — pandas 3.1.0.dev0+1386.gcb2086a1a4 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.tseries.offsets.SemiMonthBegin.day_of_month#\n\n- SemiMonthBegin.day_of_month#\n- Return the day of the month for the semi-monthly offset. This specifies the day of the month on which the offset falls, in addition to the start (1st) or end (last day) of the month. See also \n  - `SemiMonthBegin`\n  - Offset at the start of the month and mid-month.\n  - `SemiMonthEnd`\n  - Offset at mid-month and end of month.\n Examples >>> pd.offsets.SemiMonthBegin().day_of_month 15 >>> pd.offsets.SemiMonthBegin(day_of_month=20).day_of_month 20",
